On the occasion of the राजसूय, asked नारद how Caidya, शिशुपाल and Dantavaktra, haters of Hari became merged with him after their death, as also about सनातन धर्म;
4: Ib.

; ८४. २७, ६९[3].
Felt the advent of Kali everywhere: Installed his grandson परीक्षित् on the throne and Vajra at मथुरा: Prepared to go to स्वर्ग: Clad in bark, fasting, and silent, he went towards north with a view to attaining heaven: was followed by his brothers: Attained Hari through friendship.
9: Ib. I. १५. ३२-48;
